    <Requirement id="ER-P096-01-03" level="1" requirementType="test">
      <sysml:Name>管路焊缝无损检测</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水管路安装完成后，应进行水压试验，试验压力为1.5倍最大工作压力，保压时间不少于30分钟，无泄漏。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="test" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P096" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M72-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>未进行水压试验无法验证管路整体强度，存在运行风险。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>水压试验记录显示试验压力、保压时间和检查结果，无泄漏。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【管路焊缝无损检测】，来自原始需求「确保焊缝质量符合船级社规范」。E-IACS-M72-001和E-CCS-COOL-002均要求1.5倍压力水压试验保压30分钟。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
